<https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#CommitDateEdition> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionSchemeScheme> ;
    skos:notation "CommitDateEdition" ;
    skos:prefLabel "commit-date edition"@en ;
    skos:definition "The UTC date of the commit the edition is made at, a hyphen and the first eight characters of that commit: YYYY.MM.DD-commit8; never the clock."@en .

<https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SnapshotDate> a skos:Concept ;
